p4?t=1748338990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a path that leads to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >drip army combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >turn-based strategic hydration management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >procedurally generated desert</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >endless sand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sun, that always keeps you company!</p></li></ul>",
